Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Read the supplied reporting framework, organizational boundary, and amendments to determine included activities and required measures. Distinguish ownership, operational control, and other supplied boundary concepts rather than choosing whichever yields a favorable result.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
